      "annotations": [
        "The PS presents the resource token to the AS, which fetches the proposal at r3_uri and hashes the bytes it receives against r3_s256.",
        "The AS evaluates parameters per policy; the PS renders display for the person's consent. Whether either machine-evaluates the parameters — auto-denying a payment over a threshold, say — is deployment policy. The parameters are in the proposal either way.",
